@name     stream_mode
@alias    /SM
@group    seq
@type     realtime
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  set stream playback mode
@doc
Sets stream playback mode (0=wrap fwd, 1=wrap rev, 2=pingpong, 3=clamp).
Usage: /SM stream_idx mode
@code
    (void)voice;
    skode_stream_mode(NULL, (int)args[0], (int)args[1]);
    return 0;
@end
